    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26293" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχειροτον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choose between two</i> persons or proposals <i>by
				show of hands,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε . . ἤ, εἴτε . . εἴτε,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.57
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				98
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				47.43
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.7.34
			</span></i>; <i>to be selected,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				755d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>vote on</i> a person's case, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὰ πότερον ἐπιτήδειός ἐστιν ἢ
					οὔ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					49.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
